      { kind: "p", text: "We do not profile you, we do not use your data for advertising, and we do not sell it. We do not use your content to train models, and the terms of DeepInfra, Anthropic and Amazon do not allow them to; section 5 says what the web search provider may do with the search phrases the models write. The end-of-debate check evaluates a debate's synthesis, not you; we use its result for the flag on your debate, for the approval step before publishing and to delete a debate as section 6 says, and not to profile you. The question check evaluates a question, not you; we use its outcome only to decide whether the debate starts." }
